--- text
Confirm your email address

This address, [EMAIL_ADDRESS], was used to create a [PRODUCT_NAME]
account. Confirm it to finish setting up the account.

Confirm your email address:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent.

If you did not sign up for [PRODUCT_NAME], ignore this email.
Nothing will happen and the address will not be added to any
account.

We will never ask you for your password by email. If anything here
looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A
real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
